{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Sherlock Holmes' more intelligent, more\u00a0languorous older brother in this (very) short point and click experience from the world of 'The Beekeeper's Picnic'*</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES OF MYCROFT HOLMES SIMULATOR:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> the famous Diogenes Club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WALK</strong> at a very leisurely pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BE QUIET</strong> and refuse to talk to a wide range of delightful characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBSERVE</strong> things, without having to act on them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MYSTERIES! </strong>There aren't any!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains an entire ten minutes of gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*A longer, fully voice acted and critically acclaimed point and click game available now on Steam! See, Mycroft is always in his brother's shadow...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715350/extras/9808962be7d8aac92c8cffe7aea34180.avif?t=1757244340\" width=90 height=180 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715350?t=1757244340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715350/0b7c9b33635f3ea9e26ec675fca4adbb23db188f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757244340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715350/c35f9b41079a1bd129643b21e03cdd51dbe837f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757244340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715350/c35f9b41079a1bd129643b21e03cdd51dbe837f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757244340","categories":[{"description":"Single-pla